"201817":{"averageScore":71,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/201817-I5zjpJCelDjB.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5dbbf1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx201817-pyfL9F8muPeq.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx201817-pyfL9F8muPeq.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx201817-pyfL9F8muPeq.jpg"},"description":"Born into a legendary ducal family, martial prodigy Maria “Mimi” Annovazzi loses her claim as heir and is suddenly ordered to marry into prestige. With no options left in her homeland, she transfers to a neighboring kingdom—only to be publicly dumped at graduation by a prince she’s never met over an engagement she didn’t even know she had! Will Maria be doomed to the life of a spinster?!<Br><br>(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"favourites":402,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"],"hashtag":"#逃げ釣り","id":201817,"idMal":62893,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":71,"popularity":23416,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"source":"LIGHT_NOVEL","startDate":{"day":2,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":6068,"name":"TROYCA"}],"synonyms":["逃がした魚は大きかったが釣り上げた魚が大きすぎた件","Always a Catch!: How I Punched My Way into Marrying a Prince","The Fish I Missed Was Big, but the Fish I Caught Was Too Big","Nigetsuri","逃げ釣り","Ikan yang Lepas Dari Pancingku Memang Besar, Tapi Ikan yang Kutangkap Setelahnya Malah Terlalu Besar","ปล่อยปลาตัวใหญ่หลุดมือไปก็จริง แต่ไหงถึงได้ปลาตัวใหญ่กว่ามาแทนกันล่ะคะ","Để xổng mất là cá to, nhưng cá tôi câu được lại còn to hơn"],"tags":[{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":85},{"id":1327,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":85},{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":75},{"id":53,"isMediaSpoiler":fa